# File: font.prf

#
# This file defines special attr/char mappings for use in "text" mode
#
# This file includes, if appropriate, various "sub-files"
#
# See "lib/help/command.txt" and "src/files.c" for more information.
#


## #
## # OPTION: Display "veins" (white "%") as "normal walls" (white "#").
## #
## F:50:0x01/0x23
## F:51:0x01/0x23
## F:52:0x01/0x23
## F:53:0x01/0x23


##### Standard font file #####

%:font-xxx.prf

##### Load the Shades #####
%:shades.prf

##### System Specific Subfiles #####

# SDL is the only supported system - no system-specific font overrides needed
# All font configuration is handled through font-xxx.prf

?:1

